cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this dataset DOI for the AVISO data and preserved producing source. Cite the source product, ESP and scientific methods as described in the README."
type: dataset
title: "AVISO-derived mesoscale eddy dataset for the East Australian Current and Tasman Sea (1994–2019)"
authors:
  - family-names: Dowse
    given-names: Reg W.
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-6856-3115"
    affiliation: "University of New South Wales"
version: 1.0.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24575702
url: "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24575702"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/regdowse/ocean-eddy-pipeline/tree/aviso-dataset-v1.0.0"
abstract: >-
  Surface mesoscale eddy detections, fitted parameters and tracks derived from
  daily AVISO/SSALTO-DUACS absolute geostrophic velocities in the East Australian
  Current and Tasman Sea region, 2 January 1994–28 February 2019. The release
  contains 9002 eddies and 454519 processed eddy-days, intermediate stages,
  coordinate reference, configuration, provenance and the exact producing source.
